%%{init: {"theme": "neutral"} }%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor M as Merchant
    participant P as mobile / mp
    participant A as Tally apps/api
    participant S as Meta Model API
    participant Q as Qore Catalog
    participant D as Postgres (tally)

    Note over M,D: BUILT: steps 1-9 and 11 (stateless read, SAM count, match). PLANNED: storing scans, confirm.
    M->>P: photograph shelf
    P->>P: scale to 1600 px, JPEG ~400 KB
    P->>A: POST /api/businesses/:id/vision/shelf-scans [multipart, Bearer JWT]
    A->>S: muse-spark-1.3: list products {brand, name, pack, look, boxes per unit} [JSON schema]
    S-->>A: products
    par one SAM request per distinct look
        A->>S: sam-3.1: "<look>" e.g. "red box" + image
        S-->>A: instance boxes (assigned to products by position)
    and catalogue
        A->>Q: POST /v1/match (all products, x-api-key)
        Q-->>A: candidates + indicative ₦ price (plausible ones kept)
    end
    A->>D: insert vision_scans + vision_detections
    A-->>P: detections with counts, boxes, candidates
    M->>P: accept / correct / add own / remove, set qty + price
    P->>A: POST …/shelf-scans/:scanId/confirm {decisions[]}
    A->>D: new → inventory_items (source photo) + opening movement<br/>stocked → restock movement
    A->>Q: POST /v1/feedback, source "photo" (keyed by detection id)
    Note over A,Q: Best-effort: a catalogue failure never fails the confirm.
    A-->>P: {created, restocked, removed, invalid, feedback}
